"Outlook` elemre, majd a :guilabel:`Mentés` gombra."

#: ../../content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:None
msgid "Odoo for Outlook customized action"
msgstr "Az Odoo for Outlook testreszabott művelete"

#: ../../content/applications/general/integrations/mail_plugins/outlook.rst:143
